5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I worry about the people holding this together. Who is actually stretched thin right now?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"The yard equipment is old. If the system crashes during peak season, freight stops.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see where the money actually goes after the initial contract is signed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I keep seeing the same failure: nobody owns the fix when things break.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We need to check if the data moves cleanly. Bad migrations cause years of pain.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if the yard devices fail, who is on call? Is it the same two people?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Exactly. I want to know if the support team can handle a winter outage without freezing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, ownership gaps usually mean hidden costs. I want to track those invoices.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Agreed. I want to see who was blamed last time the dispatch tool failed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m looking at the 2018 pay move. If that data lift was messy, the next one will be worse.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I need to know who is retiring. If the admins leave, we lose the institutional memory.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’m checking the depot calendar. We can’t cutover during peak season. That’s a disaster waiting to happen.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look at the board minutes. They approve capital but refuse operating costs. That’s a trap.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I want to see the warehouse rule changes. If the system can’t adapt, we’re stuck.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m also checking the upgrade history. If they patch instead of upgrade, the system rots.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I’m done for now. Let’s see what the data says about the people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m done. The physical reality of the depot is my main concern.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I’m done. I need to see the full lifecycle cost, not just the sticker price.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m done. I need to know if we are walking into the same accountability hole again.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m done. I need to verify if the data architecture is sound or just a band-aid.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
