35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The admins are leaving. The last rollout failed because supervisors ignored the training. We are thin.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I found the peak season has no freeze window. The yard devices are old and the trial failed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The board approves capital but ignores operating costs. Renewals are bundled, but add-ons keep climbing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"I found the support is scattered. Last winter, nobody owned the outage for two days.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The 2018 pay move was a mess. External team, mismatched codes for a year. The dispatch tool is aging in place.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, if support is scattered, who teaches the new system? The supervisors already ignored the last one.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the dispatch tool is aging, the new system has to talk to those old yard scanners.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, if the supervisors ignore training, the operating costs will spike. The board won't cover that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, if the yard devices are old, the new system needs to be flexible enough to handle them without a full rewrite.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, if the data lift was messy, the new vendor needs to prove they can handle complex migrations without external help.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I’m worried about the people. If we pick a system that requires constant retraining, we’ll burn out the few who know how to run it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the floor. If the system can’t handle the peak season without a freeze, we lose freight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"I’m worried about the bill. If the vendor hides costs in add-ons, the board will refuse to pay them later.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’m worried about the plan. If the system can’t adapt to new accounts, we’ll be rewriting rules every six months.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m worried about the data. If the vendor can’t prove a clean migration path, we’re just buying a new way to fail.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I’m done. The human cost is the biggest risk.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m done. The physical constraints are non-negotiable.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I’m done. The financial leakage is the biggest risk.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m done. The lack of accountability is the biggest risk.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m done. The technical debt is the biggest risk.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
